      "review_summary": "The PR adds a Mattermost thread-fetch helper, recovery-gated server backfill after inbound admission, and regression coverage for cold recovery, same-session suppression, failed fetches, reset refetch, and dropped pre-admission posts.\n\nPR surface: Source +133, Tests +469. Total +602 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible. Current main lacks Mattermost server-side thread backfill, and PR head can refetch on the next same-session message when the first backfill runs before any thread session entry exists.",
